{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STARLIGHT RE:VOLVER\u2019S \u201cRE:WORK\u201d UPDATE IS OUT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras/8b1e7250d5aa9662eb687837728f4e14.avif?t=1759183508\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have completely Re:Worked the combat experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo play is now a completely viable way to Dive, across all difficulties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re:Fuel has been removed: play at your pace with more viable build options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RNG is a lesser factor for getting a peak build; an experienced player can now make any Dive work</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooldowns decreased across the board, including Dashes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy track &amp; attack behavior tuned to be less overwhelming and scales to smaller group sizes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the Re:Work update, we are also unveiling the start of our overarching narrative arc for Starlight Re:Volver. The once stable balance between Nishi Island and So Mi has begun to <i>DRIFT</i>, and the new generation of Divers has risen to the occasion to reverse it. However, a mysterious faction seeks to let it spread\u2026 over the course of Early Access, the conflict will further unfold, culminating in the first member of this mysterious faction being revealed. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gamepad support is now available, and playing on Steam Deck is now possible with the experimental Proton update. </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Linux support is not available at this point in Early Access, but will be available in the future.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Localization Update:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on reports of poor translation quality, we are temporarily removing support for other languages. Thanks for your patience as we add a higher quality translation in a future patch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u7ffb\u8a33\u306e\u8cea\u304c\u60aa\u3044\u3068\u306e\u5831\u544a\u3092\u53d7\u3051\u3001\u4e00\u6642\u7684\u306b\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3092\u505c\u6b62\u3044\u305f\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4eca\u5f8c\u3001\u3088\u308a\u9ad8\u54c1\u8cea\u306a\u7ffb\u8a33\u3092\u8ffd\u52a0\u3059\u308b\u4e88\u5b9a\u3067\u3059\u306e\u3067\u3054\u7406\u89e3\u306e\u307b\u3069\u3088\u308d\u3057\u304f\u304a\u9858\u3044\u3044\u305f\u3057\u307e\u3059\uff01 \u57fa\u4e8e\u4e2d\u6587\u7ffb\u8bd1\u8d28\u91cf\u4e0d\u4f73\u7684\u53cd\u9988\uff0c\u6211\u4eec\u5c06\u6682\u65f6\u79fb\u9664\u4e2d\u6587\u652f\u6301\u3002\u611f\u8c22\u60a8\u7684\u8010\u5fc3\u7b49\u5f85\uff0c\u6211\u4eec\u4f1a\u5728\u672a\u6765\u7684\u66f4\u65b0\u7248\u672c\u4e2d\u52a0\u5165\u66f4\u9ad8\u8d28\u91cf\u7684\u7ffb\u8bd1\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uc5ec\ub7ec\ubd84\uc758 \uc81c\ubcf4\ub85c \ud655\uc778\ub41c \ubc88\uc5ed \ud488\uc9c8 \ubb38\uc81c\ub85c, \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4 \uc9c0\uc6d0\uc744 \uc77c\uc2dc\uc801\uc73c\ub85c \uc911\ub2e8\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub354 \ub098\uc740 \ubc88\uc5ed\uc744 \ud5a5\ud6c4 \ud328\uce58\uc5d0\uc11c \uc81c\uacf5\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\ub3c4\ub85d \uc900\ube44 \uc911\uc774\ub2c8 \ub9ce\uc740 \uc591\ud574 \ubd80\ud0c1\ub4dc\ub9bd\ub2c8\ub2e4.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basado en reportes sobre la calidad de la traducci\u00f3n, vamos a remover temporalmente el soporte para la localizaci\u00f3n en Espa\u00f1ol. Agradecemos mucho su paciencia mientras agregamos una traducci\u00f3n de mejor calidad en una futura actualizaci\u00f3n. Com base em relatos sobre a m\u00e1 qualidade da tradu\u00e7\u00e3o, a l\u00edngua portuguesa est\u00e1 temporariamente indispon\u00edvel. Agradecemos sua compreens\u00e3o e paci\u00eancia enquanto elaboramos uma tradu\u00e7\u00e3o de melhor qualidade, que ser\u00e1 disponibilizada em breve.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras/dc371609504feffa2d7f254ed0a8a5d5.avif?t=1759183508\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span><strong>THANK YOU - TOP 10 MOST PLAYED DEMO OF STEAM NEXT FEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starlight Re:Volver was #10 in the most-played demos of June 2025's Steam Next Fest \ud83c\udf8a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To everyone who played our game, got their friends to play, gave us feedback, and joined our community \u2013 we are so grateful \ud83d\udc96</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT STARLIGHT RE:VOLVER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras/c0a7b7bd8c3d2eed678fcf1e2259ceaa.poster.avif?t=1759183508\" width=600 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras/c0a7b7bd8c3d2eed678fcf1e2259ceaa.webm?t=1759183508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras/c0a7b7bd8c3d2eed678fcf1e2259ceaa.mp4?t=1759183508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Transform. Team up. Dive again and again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starlight Re:Volver is a 1\u20134 player online co-op action roguelite in a vibrant anime world. Play as magical heroes, fight through dreamlike biomes, and discover new challenges every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf20 <strong>Endless Roguelite Action:</strong> No two dives are the same. Unlock abilities, swap powers, and experiment with builds to shape your combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc6f <strong>Online Co-op:</strong> Form a squad of up to 4 Divers and battle together, revive allies mid-fight, and share in the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f <strong>A Living Anime City:</strong> Between expeditions, return to Nishi Island Metropolis to fish, craft, hoverboard, and connect with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf8f <strong>Expression &amp; Style:</strong> Collect accessories, show off your look, and celebrate with festivals, fireworks, and friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Signature Soundtrack:</strong> Immerse yourself in nostalgic J-pop and citypop, featuring Sarah Bonito (Kero Kero Bonito), IRyS, LilyPichu, and more.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3201010?t=1759183508","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759183508","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/e9b5b8a3141fc4cd4fd152be0100001eb0752337/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759183508","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/e9b5b8a3141fc4cd4fd152be0100001eb0752337/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759183508","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STARLIGHT RE:VOLVER\u2019S \u201cRE:WORK\u201d UPDATE IS OUT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras/8b1e7250d5aa9662eb687837728f4e14.avif?t=1759183508\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have completel