 most-played demos of June 2025's Steam Next Fest \ud83c\udf8a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To everyone who played our game, got their friends to play, gave us feedback, and joined our community \u2013 we are so grateful \ud83d\udc96</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT STARLIGHT RE:VOLVER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras/c0a7b7bd8c3d2eed678fcf1e2259ceaa.poster.avif?t=1759183508\" width=600 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras/c0a7b7bd8c3d2eed678fcf1e2259ceaa.webm?t=1759183508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/extras/c0a7b7bd8c3d2eed678fcf1e2259ceaa.mp4?t=1759183508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Transform. Team up. Dive again and again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starlight Re:Volver is a 1\u20134 player online co-op action roguelite in a vibrant anime world. Play as magical heroes, fight through dreamlike biomes, and discover new challenges every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf20 <strong>Endless Roguelite Action:</strong> No two dives are the same. Unlock abilities, swap powers, and experiment with builds to shape your combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc6f <strong>Online Co-op:</strong> Form a squad of up to 4 Divers and battle together, revive allies mid-fight, and share in the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f <strong>A Living Anime City:</strong> Between expeditions, return to Nishi Island Metropolis to fish, craft, hoverboard, and connect with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf8f <strong>Expression &amp; Style:</strong> Collect accessories, show off your look, and celebrate with festivals, fireworks, and friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Signature Soundtrack:</strong> Immerse yourself in nostalgic J-pop and citypop, featuring Sarah Bonito (Kero Kero Bonito), IRyS, LilyPichu, and more.</p>","developers":["Pahdo Labs"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201010/9107bbf5e4577e51d79a98912926ca1238f8fde4/header.jpg?t=1759183508","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 (Catalina)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (Quad-Core, 2.5 GHz or better)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Plus / AMD Radeon Pro 555 / or Apple M1 integrated GPU</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3201010/117804694/2f126f5311d984f3cfe4f2f928ac33ad1f6c610d/1756252156/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756254571","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3201010/117804694/2f126f5311d984f3cfe4f2f928ac33ad1f6c610d/1756252156/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756254571","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3201010/117804694/2f126f5311d984f3cfe4f2f928ac33ad1f6c610d/1756252156/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756254571","id":257189398,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189398/movie480.mp4?t=1756254571","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189398/movie_max.mp4?t=1756254571"},"name":"Release Date Announcement (ft. IRyS)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257189398/a2632190125433beba3678601a92fb1b2a4604cf/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756254571","webm":{"48